# Prompt Evaluation Workflow

1. Buffer Prompt in IDE
2. Run Cron Job to Process Buffer (every 15 minutes)
3. BART Classify Prompts and Filter Kept Entries
4. Ollama Generate Metadata for Kept Prompts
5. ChromaDB Similiarity Search & Upsert Memory (if valid entry)
6. RuleEvaluator.evaluate() if Memory is Stored (not after every prompt)
